      "id": "01447d5157e5bd7c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "###### 90 PV\n\n**Físico 1d10**\n**Mente 1d4**\n**Emoção 1d8**\n\nDisciplina 1d6\nLuta 1d8\nPercepção 1d8\nPontaria 1d8",
      "ffcBorder": "none",
